    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats, or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No transient loss of vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Two loose back teeth without pain; hearing normal</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in bowel habit, bleeding, or indigestion on aspirin</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>More frequent urination in the mornings since the diuretic; normal stream</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No muscle aches on atorvastatin; no joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No changing moles</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No weakness, numbness, speech trouble, or dizziness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood fair; PHQ-2 score 1</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

